+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# THE POPULATION GAP (2026-07-26). The test above proves the PREDICATE is right. It cannot prove
+# the FIELDS THE PREDICATE READS ARE EVER POPULATED, because it hand-writes them as dict literals
